Now and at the start of your
next turn, choose one: +$1;
or trash a card from your hand;
or gain a Silver.

Trash a card from your
hand and choose one:
+1 Card per $1 it costs;
or +1 Action per $1 it costs;
or +$1 per $1 it costs;
or +1 Favor per $1 it costs.

After playing a Liaison,
if you have 5 or more Favors, +$1,
and if 10 or more, +1 Action and +1 Buy.

Choose one:
+1 Card and +2 Actions;
or +1 Buy and +$2.

Choose one: +$2;
or gain a Silver;
or +1 Card and +1 Action.

You may rotate the Townsfolk.

Choose one: Discard 2 cards;
or put a card from your hand
onto your deck;
or gain a Copper.

Choose one: +$3; or trash
your hand; or gain a Duchy.

+5 Cards

Reveal your hand;
discard the Coppers.

Choose two: +1 Card;
+1 Action; +1 Buy; +$1.
The choices must be different.

Gain a card costing
up to $4. If it's an...

Action card, gain a Horse;
Treasure card, gain a Silver;
Victory card, +1 Card
and +1 Action.

Trash a card from your hand.
Choose a different thing
per $1 it costs: +1 Card;
+1 Action; +1 Buy; +$1;
gain a Silver; gain a Horse.

Follow this card's instructions;
each time that would give you +Cards
this turn, you get +$ instead, and vice-versa.

If the number of cards
you've gained this turn is:

2+, gain an Imp;
1, gain a card costing up
to $4;
0, gain a Gold.

Choose one: Trash a card from your hand;
or gain an Estate from the trash, and if you did,
gain a card costing up to $5.

+$3

Choose one: Trash a
Treasure from your hand;
or gain a Treasure from
the trash to your hand;
or take the Key.

If the number of Aristocats
you have in play is:

1 or 5: +3 Actions;
2 or 6: +3 Cards;
